{"id":2218,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2218"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:18:59","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:18:59","slug":"medium-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/medium-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Medium Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"444\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"442\">Durable Medium Cardboard Boxes for Shipping<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"621\">Medium Cardboard Boxes are widely used for shipping, storage, and retail packaging. They provide a balanced size option that is neither too large nor too small, making them suitable for many industries. Whether you are moving household items, packing retail goods, or storing office supplies, these boxes provide durability and reliable structure.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"873\">At <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"681\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a>, we manufacture <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"731\">custom medium cardboard boxes<\/strong> with flexible sizing, printing, and finishing options. Businesses can order in wholesale quantities with fast turnaround and free shipping.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"288\"><strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"286\">Packaging solutions in cube dimensions<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1334\">Some packaging needs a more symmetrical design. That\u2019s where <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1080\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cube-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1078\">Cube Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> become a strong option. They offer equal dimensions on all sides, which helps in shipping uniform products such as electronics, small appliances, and retail kits. Linking cube styles with medium-sized boxes gives businesses more packaging flexibility.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"3204\">\n<thead data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1582\">\n<tr data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1582\">\n<th data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1414\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"md\">Options Available<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1495\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1530\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Finishing Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1582\" data-col-size=\"md\">Applications<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"3204\">\n<tr data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1986\">\n<td data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1818\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Dimensions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1867\" data-col-size=\"md\">Medium sizes (customizable on request)<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1900\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated, Kraft, White SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1986\" data-col-size=\"md\">Storage, Shipping, Retail packing<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2189\">\n<td data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2020\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing Support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2069\" data-col-size=\"md\">CMYK, Pantone, Logo and Brand printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12pt\u201324pt board thickness<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2138\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Offset or Digital print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2189\" data-col-size=\"md\">Marketing, Brand recognition, Retail display<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2392\">\n<td data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Styles<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"md\">Slotted, Die-cut, Foldable, Mailer<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2305\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rigid cardboard, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foil stamping, Embossing, Deboss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2392\" data-col-size=\"md\">E-commerce, Wholesale, Bulk shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2595\">\n<td data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2426\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inserts &amp; Dividers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2475\" data-col-size=\"md\">Foam, Cardboard partitions, Custom trays<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2508\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recycled or New board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2544\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Plain, Coated, Soft-touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2595\" data-col-size=\"md\">Organizing products, Fragile item protection<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2798\">\n<td data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strength Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2678\" data-col-size=\"md\">Single wall, Double wall, Triple wall<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">FSC-certified board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Laminated, Anti-scratch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2798\" data-col-size=\"md\">Heavy-duty storage, Secure transportation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"3001\">\n<td data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco-Friendly Packaging<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2881\" data-col-size=\"md\">100% recyclable and biodegradable options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft paperboard, Eco corrugate<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2950\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte eco-laminate<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"3001\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sustainable packaging for businesses<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3204\">\n<td data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3035\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Add-ons<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3084\" data-col-size=\"md\">Die-cut handles, Easy-open flaps, Tear strips<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3117\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Same as box material<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3153\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Window cut-outs<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3153\" data-end=\"3204\" data-col-size=\"md\">User-friendly packaging, Retail presentation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3209\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3250\">Benefits of medium cardboard boxes<\/h2>\n<ol data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3522\">\n<li data-start=\"3252\" data-end=\"3307\">\n<p data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3307\">Balanced size makes them useful for many products.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3356\">\n<p data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3356\">Strong structure for shipping and handling.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3420\">\n<p data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3420\">Compatible with inserts and dividers for extra protection.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3468\">\n<p data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3468\">Fully customizable printing and finishing.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3469\" data-end=\"3522\">\n<p data-start=\"3472\" data-end=\"3522\">Affordable wholesale supply with quick delivery.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h2 data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"247\"><strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"245\">Different packaging sizes and shapes available<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3988\">Packaging needs vary across industries. Retailers and manufacturers often explore <strong data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3796\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3794\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/a><\/strong> to find options best suited for their products. From small boxes for jewellery to extra-large cartons for storage, businesses can select packaging that ensures both safety and presentation.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3990\" data-end=\"3993\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4083\">Order <strong data-start=\"4022\" data-end=\"4048\">Medium Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> today from Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4324\">\n<li data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4137\">\n<p data-start=\"4087\" data-end=\"4137\">Available in Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV finishes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4138\" data-end=\"4194\">\n<p data-start=\"4140\" data-end=\"4194\">Free design support for custom artwork and branding.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4257\">\n<p data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4257\">Sizes and styles suited for retail, shipping, and storage.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4324\">\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4324\">Bulk supply with fast turnaround and free nationwide delivery.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4488\">Our boxes are designed to balance durability, cost-efficiency, and presentation. Choose medium-sized packaging for a solution that fits everyday business needs.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for medium cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our medium cardboard boxes are perfect for packing and shipping medium-sized items. We offer a variety of sizes and styles to fit your needs. Our boxes are made from high-quality materials and are printed with high-quality inks. We also offer various coating options, including gloss, matte, and spot UV. We offer free design and shipping on all orders. Custom sizes and styles are available. Contact us today to get started on your custom order!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2251,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[179],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2218","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Medium Cardboard Boxes And Packaging Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shop high-quality Medium Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices. Custom sizes, styles, printing, and free design with fast shipping.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/medium-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Medium Cardboard Boxes And Packaging Wholesale\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shop high-quality Medium Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices. Custom sizes, styles, printing, and free design with fast shipping.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/medium-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T15:18:59+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Medium-Cardboard-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:w